---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConsultForm from '../components/ConsultForm.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Shipping & Logistics — Exporta Global" description="Freight forwarding, incoterms, and shipment coordination handled correctly, every time — so your goods arrive on schedule and on budget.">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; <a href="/#services">Services</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Shipping & Logistics</div>
    <span class="pill">Shipping & Logistics</span>
    <div class="ic-lg"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:52px;height:52px;color:var(--accent-2)"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg></div>
    <h1>Shipping & Logistics</h1>
    <p class="sub">Freight forwarding, incoterms, and shipment coordination handled correctly, every time — so your goods arrive on schedule and on budget.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#consult" class="btn btn-accent">Get a Free Consultation →</a>
      <a href="#how" class="btn btn-ghost">How it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="prose reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Overview</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Ship smarter, not more expensively.</h2>
      <p>Mis-chosen incoterms, the wrong freight mode, or a missed booking window can quietly erase your margin. Logistics is where many first-time exporters lose money.</p><p>We coordinate the entire shipping process — selecting the right incoterms, freight partners, and routing — and keep you informed from booking to delivery.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="checklist" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Sea, air & land freight</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Incoterms selection</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Optimized routing</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Cargo insurance guidance</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>End-to-end tracking</p></div>
      <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Transparent landed-cost</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">What's included</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Everything in this service</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/></svg></div><h3>Freight forwarding</h3><p>Vetted freight partners for sea, air, and land at competitive rates.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 11 12 14 22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/></svg></div><h3>Incoterms guidance</h3><p>The right terms so risk and cost sit where they should.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg></div><h3>Route optimization</h3><p>Cost- and time-optimized routing for each shipment.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div><h3>Cargo insurance</h3><p>Guidance on protecting your goods in transit.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div><h3>Shipment tracking</h3><p>Visibility from booking through to final delivery.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg></div><h3>Cost control</h3><p>Landed-cost clarity so there are no surprises.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2 class="h2">A clear, proven process</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Plan</h3><p>We choose incoterms, mode, and routing for your shipment.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">2</div><h3>Book</h3><p>We arrange freight with vetted partners at good rates.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Track</h3><p>We monitor the shipment and keep you updated.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">4</div><h3>Deliver</h3><p>Your goods arrive on time, with no surprises.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Common questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Do you arrange the actual freight?</h4><p>We coordinate with vetted freight forwarders and manage the process on your behalf, so you deal with one point of contact.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Which incoterm should I use?</h4><p>It depends on your buyer, product, and risk appetite — we recommend the right one for each deal rather than a one-size-fits-all answer.</p></div>
    <div class="qa reveal"><h4>Can you reduce my shipping costs?</h4><p>Often yes — through better incoterms, routing, consolidation, and partner rates.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<ConsultForm serviceHighlight="shipping & logistics" selectedService="Shipping & Logistics" />
</BaseLayout>
